/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
/setlistarray.apk
/.screenshots
/setlistarray.aab
/.shots
/scripts/__pycache__
# The finished listing images (card S2). They are a pure function of the seed,
# the shot list and the app, and `scripts/store-frame.py` rebuilds them from
# `.shots/` in a minute — so the repository keeps the words, which are worth
# reviewing in a diff, and not the two megabytes of PNG, which are not. Card
# S4's workflow regenerates them on the runner and attaches them to the run for
# a human to look at before anything reaches Play.
/store/metadata/en-US/images

# The landing page's derived halves (card "Website?"). `site/index.html` and
# `site/style.css` are written by hand and belong in a diff; these two
# directories are built from things that are already in the repository —
# `scripts/site-fonts.py` cuts the faces out of `assets/fonts/`, and
# `scripts/store-frame.py --preset site` crops the plates out of the frames the
# Listing workflow photographs. Same bargain as the listing images above: keep
# what is worth reviewing, rebuild what is a pure function of it.
/site/fonts
/site/img
